WEBVTT

00:01:32.840 --> 00:01:34.760
Go, Shoot!

00:01:51.880 --> 00:01:53.660
Uriel!

00:02:00.620 --> 00:02:30.010
Suzaku!

00:02:30.740 --> 00:02:33.880
While the qualifiers
reach their end,

00:02:33.880 --> 00:02:37.890
King and Queen appear
before the team.

00:02:38.160 --> 00:02:42.560
Kai takes him on to get revenge
but the battle ends in a draw.

00:02:42.560 --> 00:02:47.490
And team is shocked to hear that King
and Queen have entered the tournament.

00:02:48.740 --> 00:02:53.520
There's an air of uneasiness brewing
in the world championships.

00:03:27.870 --> 00:03:28.680
What?

00:03:28.680 --> 00:03:31.180
I see. Let him in.

00:03:42.430 --> 00:03:44.950
It's been a long time, Daitenji.

00:03:45.160 --> 00:03:46.870
What do you want?

00:03:48.780 --> 00:03:51.370
Is that your way
of greeting me?

00:03:53.710 --> 00:03:57.920
Saying "what do you want" to a friend
you haven't seen in thirty years...

00:03:57.920 --> 00:04:00.140
Thirty years...

00:04:00.140 --> 00:04:07.210
Has it been that long since you
disappeared along with the stone tablet?

00:04:07.210 --> 00:04:11.040
I never thought we'd see
each other again, Zagart.

00:04:11.360 --> 00:04:14.380
I have thirty years' worth
of questions to ask you!

00:04:15.850 --> 00:04:19.250
Did your people steal
the tablet in New York?

00:04:19.250 --> 00:04:25.250
Did you send Bladers with Sacred Beasts
to attack Kinomiya and his friends?

00:04:25.680 --> 00:04:27.480
Allow me to
make my case.

00:04:27.480 --> 00:04:31.530
You will answer my questions,
first. How about it, Zagart?

00:04:31.700 --> 00:04:35.330
If that's what you believe I did,
you are free to believe it.

00:04:35.330 --> 00:04:36.930
What?

00:04:37.130 --> 00:04:43.650
I want you to allow these two to enter in the last
qualifying block of the world championships.

00:04:50.500 --> 00:04:52.600
This boy is...

00:04:53.360 --> 00:04:55.300
If you please, Daitenji.

00:04:55.300 --> 00:04:56.740
Wait right there!

00:04:56.740 --> 00:04:58.720
'Sup, old timer!

00:04:58.720 --> 00:04:59.820
Kinomiya!

00:04:59.820 --> 00:05:02.490
I wanted to
ask you something.

00:05:02.490 --> 00:05:05.520
Who's going to
the final rounds?

00:05:05.520 --> 00:05:08.250
We were hoping
you could tell us.

00:05:09.440 --> 00:05:10.560
A visitor?

00:05:10.560 --> 00:05:12.160
Sorry about that.

00:05:12.160 --> 00:05:15.260
I told you we should
make an appointment!

00:05:15.260 --> 00:05:16.800
I'm so sorry!

00:05:17.060 --> 00:05:18.900
Don't leave, Zagart!

00:05:18.900 --> 00:05:19.980
Zagart?!

00:05:19.980 --> 00:05:21.380
What did you say?

00:05:23.200 --> 00:05:24.700
Wait!

00:05:25.440 --> 00:05:29.010
We finally found you!
So you're Zagart?!

00:05:29.010 --> 00:05:31.340
And you're Takao Kinomiya.

00:05:31.340 --> 00:05:36.970
So he's the boss of the people who've been attacking us with Sacred Beasts?

00:05:36.970 --> 00:05:39.290
And the people who
stole my mom's tablet!

00:05:39.290 --> 00:05:42.480
But why is he here in
Chairman Daitenji's office?

00:05:42.480 --> 00:05:47.450
He came to enter these
two in the tournament.

00:05:47.450 --> 00:05:48.570
--Zeo!

00:05:48.570 --> 00:05:49.940
What?

00:05:49.940 --> 00:05:52.120
Why is Zeo...?

00:05:52.120 --> 00:05:54.580
Explain yourself, Zagart!

00:05:55.820 --> 00:05:58.090
It's natural, of course.

00:05:58.090 --> 00:06:02.650
All I'm doing is entering a very
important player into this tournament.

00:06:02.650 --> 00:06:05.510
My dear son, that is.

00:06:07.010 --> 00:06:08.860
What?!

00:06:09.050 --> 00:06:10.450
I'll protect it!

00:06:10.450 --> 00:06:11.490
Zeo's dad is... Zagart?

00:06:11.490 --> 00:06:13.300
--Stop!

00:06:14.450 --> 00:06:17.930
No way! You expect
me to buy that?

00:06:17.930 --> 00:06:23.920
Yeah! He fought together with
us against enemy Sacred Beasts!

00:06:23.920 --> 00:06:26.570
Are you trying
to trick us?!

00:06:26.570 --> 00:06:30.360
Zeo is not the same
boy he once was.

00:06:30.360 --> 00:06:34.740
He only considers you
enemies to defeat.

00:06:34.740 --> 00:06:38.140
Enemies to defeat?

00:06:38.140 --> 00:06:40.780
From here on out,
we're enemies.

00:06:40.780 --> 00:06:43.240
Forget everything
we've been through!

00:06:43.240 --> 00:06:46.240
Next time we meet,
I will defeat you!

00:06:46.460 --> 00:06:47.820
Zeo...

00:06:48.080 --> 00:06:54.260
Zeo has improved so much to command
a Beyblade with Cerberus within it.

00:06:54.420 --> 00:06:55.680
Cerberus?

00:06:55.680 --> 00:06:57.280
You mean...

00:06:57.920 --> 00:07:03.480
The strongest of all Sacred Beasts that
dwells deep within the stone tablet.

00:07:04.780 --> 00:07:07.240
Zeo has a
Sacred Beast...?

00:07:07.240 --> 00:07:10.290
Zagart, I knew it! You're...

00:07:10.290 --> 00:07:12.100
Takao Kinomiya.

00:07:12.100 --> 00:07:16.940
My beloved Zeo will defeat
your four Sacred Beasts.

00:07:16.940 --> 00:07:18.690
I hope you're ready.

00:07:19.560 --> 00:07:22.220
So it was all
leading up to this.

00:07:22.220 --> 00:07:24.040
Get real!

00:07:24.040 --> 00:07:27.980
You'd use your own son
for your crazy scheme?!

00:07:27.980 --> 00:07:32.780
It's inhumane!
And I won't allow it!

00:07:37.410 --> 00:07:42.440
Kids, look forward to
seeing a reigned in Zeo.

00:07:42.440 --> 00:07:45.580
Let's meet again in the
arena for the final rounds.

00:07:47.730 --> 00:07:50.260
Get back here, Zagart!

00:07:52.450 --> 00:07:54.770
Are you sure about
this, Chairman?

00:07:54.770 --> 00:07:57.690
Are you going to just let
him walk all over you?!

00:07:57.690 --> 00:08:02.500
I don't have any proof that he's
doing anything against the law.

00:08:02.500 --> 00:08:07.360
As long as he's put
in a request to enter,

00:08:07.360 --> 00:08:10.840
I have no choice
but to accept it.

00:08:10.840 --> 00:08:14.860
So we might have to fight
Zeo in the final rounds?

00:08:14.860 --> 00:08:16.220
No...

00:08:16.850 --> 00:08:22.330
I just can't believe that Zeo would
go along with his dad's plans.

00:08:22.330 --> 00:08:23.850
Right.

00:08:23.850 --> 00:08:27.760
But why did Zeo
suddenly turn on us?

00:08:27.760 --> 00:08:33.260
I don't know. But I don't care
what anyone says. I trust him.

00:08:45.680 --> 00:08:48.810
Come on! Give me all
you've got, Zeo!

00:08:48.810 --> 00:08:50.660
Let's go, Cerberus!

00:08:50.660 --> 00:08:51.860
Orthros!

00:09:31.980 --> 00:09:35.740
Takao, I've crossed the
point of no return.

00:09:35.740 --> 00:09:40.170
I have to beat you and
take the four Sacred Beasts!

00:09:40.170 --> 00:09:42.400
If I can't...

00:09:42.400 --> 00:09:45.080
I... I'll...

00:09:52.180 --> 00:09:53.800
Takao...!

00:10:10.500 --> 00:10:11.800
Shoot!

00:10:15.180 --> 00:10:17.820
Go! Slam into it, Uriel!

00:10:20.390 --> 00:10:22.370
Go, go, go!

00:10:24.120 --> 00:10:26.520
What do you think
of Uriel's power?

00:10:26.520 --> 00:10:28.240
It's got a long
way to go.

00:10:28.240 --> 00:10:33.010
The other entrants in the
finals will eat you for breakfast.

00:10:33.010 --> 00:10:34.290
What?!

00:10:34.540 --> 00:10:36.740
Then, it's my turn!

00:10:36.740 --> 00:10:38.800
Go, Gabriel!

00:10:44.450 --> 00:10:49.450
When it comes to customized Beys,
my Gabriel stands above all the rest!

00:10:49.610 --> 00:10:52.140
No way!
Uriel is better!

00:10:52.140 --> 00:10:53.490
Oh, shut up!

00:10:53.490 --> 00:10:56.220
Show him he's
wrong, Gabriel!

00:10:56.220 --> 00:10:57.940
Uriel!

00:11:04.860 --> 00:11:09.380
Their power and technique.
Plus, their unwavering drive...

00:11:09.380 --> 00:11:11.810
This is exactly
what I wanted.

00:11:23.260 --> 00:11:25.980
See that?
This is our power.

00:11:33.630 --> 00:11:37.840
Hey, Kyoujyu! Why didn't
you say something sooner?!

00:11:37.840 --> 00:11:43.170
Yeah! I thought we all agreed
to go see Zeo's first battle!

00:11:43.170 --> 00:11:48.240
I only noticed the e-mail from
Chairman Daitenji just now!

00:11:48.240 --> 00:11:50.290
Don't blame me!

00:11:52.120 --> 00:11:53.900
I don't get it!

00:11:53.900 --> 00:11:59.320
This might be our last chance
to ask Zeo what's going on!

00:11:59.320 --> 00:12:02.800
We haven't even been able
figure out where he lives.

00:12:02.800 --> 00:12:06.020
I know that.
But don't worry.

00:12:06.020 --> 00:12:09.820
We have plenty of
time before his match.

00:12:09.820 --> 00:12:12.020
But we shouldn't dally.
Let's move.

00:12:12.020 --> 00:12:13.020
Right.

00:12:13.980 --> 00:12:19.560
I want to know, Zeo... Why you
started taking orders from your dad...

00:12:19.560 --> 00:12:23.700
And why you left us
in the first place...

00:12:24.510 --> 00:12:34.440
"Bakuten Shoot Beyblade 2002"

00:12:38.980 --> 00:12:40.220
That was cool!

00:12:40.220 --> 00:12:42.780
The way he won
was so awesome!

00:12:47.260 --> 00:12:50.610
Hey! Zeo's match
is here, right?

00:12:50.610 --> 00:12:52.860
Yeah, but it just ended.

00:12:52.860 --> 00:12:54.050
--What?!
--What?!

00:12:54.050 --> 00:12:56.760
I've never seen a
battle like that before.

00:12:56.760 --> 00:13:02.040
It was so one-sided that the other guy
didn't even have time to attack!

00:13:03.540 --> 00:13:04.930
Takao!

00:13:12.730 --> 00:13:14.440
What happened?

00:13:16.420 --> 00:13:22.170
So Zeo's team was so strong
that the match finished early?

00:13:22.170 --> 00:13:23.160
What?!

00:13:23.160 --> 00:13:25.200
Is that true?

00:13:25.200 --> 00:13:32.280
Sure is. Their matches mostly ended in one
attack, so they just keep rising up the ranks.

00:13:32.580 --> 00:13:36.520
Especially Zeo.
He was something else!

00:13:36.520 --> 00:13:40.610
He might even win
the tournament!

00:13:40.940 --> 00:13:42.780
Zeo could...

00:13:49.090 --> 00:13:50.720
Well, Takao?

00:13:51.130 --> 00:13:55.180
It's as plain as day. Zeo isn't the
same person he used to be.

00:13:55.180 --> 00:13:57.520
Zagart might have
been telling the truth.

00:13:57.520 --> 00:13:59.960
How do you know?

00:13:59.960 --> 00:14:05.120
Zeo won his way through these
qualifiers with brute force.

00:14:05.120 --> 00:14:09.010
I could never imagine the
Zeo we know doing that.

00:14:21.570 --> 00:14:24.180
Stop moping, Kinomiya.

00:14:24.440 --> 00:14:26.620
The final rounds are
coming up soon.

00:14:26.620 --> 00:14:30.730
Don't let yourself get
dragged down by Zeo.

00:14:30.730 --> 00:14:31.360
Kai...

00:14:31.360 --> 00:14:35.520
He's right! Just imagine that Zeo's
doing his best in his own way.

00:14:35.520 --> 00:14:38.920
We need to
focus on winning.

00:14:38.920 --> 00:14:40.740
That's right, Takao!

00:14:41.410 --> 00:14:44.440
Yeah, that's true...

00:14:52.370 --> 00:14:53.410
Wow...

00:14:53.410 --> 00:14:55.620
Hey! Thank you,
thank you!

00:14:55.620 --> 00:14:59.810
This really feels like a press
conference for the world championships.

00:14:59.810 --> 00:15:04.090
Takao's attitude has done a
complete 180 since yesterday...

00:15:04.320 --> 00:15:07.720
A word from last year's
champions, please!

00:15:07.720 --> 00:15:12.600
We're just gonna fight
like we've always have!

00:15:13.860 --> 00:15:17.240
I ask that you save your
questions for the press room.

00:15:17.240 --> 00:15:19.180
It's been a
while, Kinomiya.

00:15:19.760 --> 00:15:21.530
It's Ozma!

00:15:22.840 --> 00:15:25.020
You guys made it to
the final rounds, too?

00:15:25.020 --> 00:15:26.240
Yeah.

00:15:26.240 --> 00:15:30.600
We haven't seen you guys since
our battle at the amusement park.

00:15:30.600 --> 00:15:35.400
We've got a score to
settle from back then!

00:15:35.780 --> 00:15:39.080
Bring it on!
We'll be ready!

00:15:43.010 --> 00:15:44.700
It's King and Queen...

00:15:44.700 --> 00:15:47.140
Here come the
parts hunters...

00:15:47.140 --> 00:15:49.300
Do you know about them?

00:15:49.300 --> 00:15:52.360
Yeah, there are rumors
about them everywhere!

00:15:52.360 --> 00:15:55.720
I wouldn't call them
"good" rumors, though...

00:15:55.720 --> 00:16:00.780
I hear they've joined up with the group
trying to steal the Sacred Beasts.

00:16:00.780 --> 00:16:02.700
You mean Zagart?

00:16:03.060 --> 00:16:07.730
Stay on your toes.
This tournament demands that of you.

00:16:26.700 --> 00:16:30.050
After a meeting to
decide the bracket,

00:16:30.050 --> 00:16:35.010
we can now announce the matchups for
the final rounds of the world championships.

00:16:40.560 --> 00:16:44.520
Block A: Takao Kinomiya/
Max Mizuhara team

00:16:44.520 --> 00:16:46.440
VS the Kane Yamashita/Jim team.

00:16:46.440 --> 00:16:49.580
All right! We're up
against you guys first!

00:16:49.580 --> 00:16:51.840
How exciting!

00:16:53.280 --> 00:16:56.040
Kane... We have a strong
opponent right from round one...

00:16:56.040 --> 00:17:00.000
It doesn't matter who you're up
against. Don't lose to them, Takao.

00:17:00.000 --> 00:17:04.730
Block B: Yusuf/Mariam team
VS the King/Queen team.

00:17:05.540 --> 00:17:09.210
I feel bad for these nobodies
having to fight us.

00:17:09.210 --> 00:17:10.530
I know, right?

00:17:11.170 --> 00:17:14.090
Keep your sympathy.

00:17:14.770 --> 00:17:17.730
Fighting these guys
looks like fun!

00:17:17.730 --> 00:17:22.770
Block C: Sanchez/Marco team VS
the Kai Hiwatari/Rei Kon team!

00:17:25.920 --> 00:17:27.500
What the hell?

00:17:27.780 --> 00:17:29.880
I heard they're the
Central American champions.

00:17:29.880 --> 00:17:32.480
They might be stronger
than they let on.

00:17:32.480 --> 00:17:34.370
Don't underestimate them.

00:17:34.370 --> 00:17:39.410
And finally, Block D: The Ozma/Dunga
team VS the Zeo/Gordo team!

00:17:45.960 --> 00:17:49.720
The Zeo/Gordo pair
are absent today.

00:17:49.720 --> 00:17:50.740
As I thought...

00:17:50.740 --> 00:17:52.130
Zeo...

00:17:53.320 --> 00:17:59.960
With the pairings you see before you,
the final rounds will begin tomorrow.

00:17:59.960 --> 00:18:07.210
To the players battling to become world
champions, I truly wish that they

00:18:07.210 --> 00:18:13.880
compete fairly in a way befitting
of a pure Blader spirit.

00:18:13.880 --> 00:18:14.680
Additionally...

00:18:14.680 --> 00:18:16.000
Shut up!

00:18:17.050 --> 00:18:20.000
I don't wanna hear
this boring nonsense!

00:18:20.330 --> 00:18:26.370
Yeah. We only really care
about Takao Kinomiya's team.

00:18:26.370 --> 00:18:27.290
What?!

00:18:27.290 --> 00:18:29.800
Their Beys, more specifically.

00:18:29.800 --> 00:18:32.700
The rest of you
are just fodder.

00:18:33.140 --> 00:18:34.800
Hold on!

00:18:34.800 --> 00:18:36.730
What's that
supposed to mean?!

00:18:36.730 --> 00:18:41.520
Fodder like you should just
pack it in and go home.

00:18:41.520 --> 00:18:43.050
Mama's waiting for you.

00:18:43.050 --> 00:18:44.500
You son of a--

00:18:44.500 --> 00:18:46.000
Dunga, stop!

00:18:47.130 --> 00:18:48.270
Hey!

00:18:51.570 --> 00:18:53.370
Uriel!

00:18:55.440 --> 00:18:56.620
Damn!

00:18:56.620 --> 00:18:58.820
Voltic Ape!

00:19:03.460 --> 00:19:05.010
Stop, Dunga!

00:19:05.010 --> 00:19:07.130
You too, King!

00:19:09.050 --> 00:19:10.120
Doctor...

00:19:10.120 --> 00:19:13.630
Don't worry.
This is how they operate.

00:19:16.570 --> 00:19:18.500
How could this happen?

00:19:18.810 --> 00:19:22.890
That's enough, Dunga!
Don't let them get under your skin!

00:19:34.580 --> 00:19:36.570
Uriel!

00:19:42.120 --> 00:19:44.530
Voltic Ape!!

00:19:53.060 --> 00:19:56.850
Dang it! No other choice!
Go, Dragoon!

00:20:02.520 --> 00:20:06.090
Look forward to
battling us later.

00:20:07.090 --> 00:20:09.300
Keep up the chaos, King!

00:20:09.300 --> 00:20:10.740
Uriel!

00:20:20.100 --> 00:20:23.330
No! All of you, stop this!

00:20:25.770 --> 00:20:27.160
Driger!

00:20:27.160 --> 00:20:28.410
Dranzer!

00:20:28.410 --> 00:20:29.720
Draciel!

00:20:45.620 --> 00:20:47.610
Are you okay, old man?

00:20:47.610 --> 00:20:48.500
Chairman!

00:20:48.500 --> 00:20:50.380
Thank you.

00:20:50.380 --> 00:20:54.240
Kids! You mustn't
battle here recklessly!

00:20:54.240 --> 00:20:57.970
You can settle your
grudges tomorrow,

00:20:57.970 --> 00:21:03.570
in a fair-and-square match in the world championships.

00:21:03.570 --> 00:21:05.170
Understood?

00:21:08.370 --> 00:21:12.580
The battles to decide the world
champion are finally about to begin!

00:21:12.580 --> 00:21:15.000
Yeah. I can't wait!

00:22:59.610 --> 00:23:03.260
The final rounds of the world
championships have finally begun!

00:23:03.260 --> 00:23:05.180
The first match
is Ozma VS Zeo!

00:23:05.180 --> 00:23:09.180
Things are starting off with a bang!
I wonder who's going to win?

00:23:09.180 --> 00:23:12.940
What's that, Chairman?
"Be mindful of stray gunfire?"

00:23:12.940 --> 00:23:17.340
We're not talking about real bullets!
Or even fake ones!

00:23:17.340 --> 00:23:19.450
That joke was a real
shot in the dark!

00:23:19.450 --> 00:23:21.450
Watch the next episode too, okay?
